The optional local open-voice input path uses Silero VAD's small 16-kHz ONNX
model on CPU, MIT-licensed upstream at https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad.
Weights are not part of this source archive: bootstrap/startup fetches revision
066409f3d9db45a30d21dfcbf9147826ffdd7052 and verifies the SHA256 in pause_vad.py.
The NumPy/ONNX streaming interface retains state only for the current session.

